          "explanation": "Shows targeted extraction of decision-critical fields from the pending CT report instead of asking for full unclear documents.",
          "quote": "把以下几行关键内容发给我即可"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00464",
          "explanation": "Shows the caregiver acted on the verification strategy by reporting the decision-critical CT fields.",
          "quote": "左侧输尿管结石，约6mm"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "For the ambiguous CT/report thread, the doctor identified the need for official report details, specified the critical fields to extract, reconciled them with symptoms and red flags, and preserved urgent-care thresholds while awaiting verification. This meaningfully changed the trajectory by getting the caregiver to return structured CT information rather than blurry or incomplete photos.",
      "ho_id": "HO3",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
      "triggered": true
    },
    {
      "active_model_action": false,
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00056",
          "explanation": "The mixed-document thread made colonoscopy records visible, but the doctor did not pursue pathology-result ownership or endoscopy follow-up.",
          "quote": "肠镜、麻醉单、肾囊肿手术、出院小结"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "not_completed",
      "explanation": "The colonoscopy/document thread was visible, but the doctor never asked whether pathology had returned, never assigned an endoscopy/pathology result-review owner, and never separated that follow-up thread from the urologic plan.",
      "ho_id": "HO4",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": false,
      "triggered": true
    }
  ],
